SUMMARY:The Only Living Pickpocket in New York
LOCATION:Triplex Cinema\, 70 Railroad St\, Great Barrington\, MA 01230
DESCRIPTION:Times: 2:15pm\, 5:15pm\, 8:15pm\nHarry Lehman is an aging pickp
 ocket who plies his trade with ever-diminishing returns in a drastically c
 hanged New York. Wallets stuffed with cash have been replaced by easily ca
 ncelled credit cards\, and Harry struggles to make ends meet as he cares f
 or his disabled wife\, Rosie. When he unwittingly purloins and fences a va
 luable USB stick\, Harry finds himself in a race against time to return th
 e loot or face the rage of a vengeful crime family.\nhttps://www.thetriple
 x.org/movie/the-only-living-pickpocket-in-new-york\nFrom Pushpin Western M
 ass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.thetriplex.org/movie/the-only-living-pickpocket-in-new-york
END:VEVENT
